{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15106950","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15106950","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1510695001:0":{"text":"豊穣神、あなたはなぜトータスを滅ぼしたのですか？","source_cn":"丰饶神，你为何要覆灭图塔镇？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7E12E1F4AB0610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510695002:1":{"text":"黙れ！卑しい凡俗どもの生死は、この儂が決めるのだ！","source_cn":"住嘴！那群卑贱的凡人，生与死皆由我来定夺！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52938618CD943523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510695003:0":{"text":"堕落した神よ、人々の命を奪う権利など、あなたにはありません。無垢な魂が、あなたの糧になっていいはずがないのです！","source_cn":"堕落的神明，你无权随意剥夺凡人的生命，他们无辜的灵魂不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36F6ACE4B2FC28ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510695004:1":{"text":"雨を降らせ、豊穣をもたらした儂を、奴らは裏切ったのだ！","source_cn":"我降下甘霖，赐予他们丰收。是他们背叛了我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805A238197969430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510695005:0":{"text":"信仰を捧げ、堕落の苦しみから儂を救うことこそ、凡俗の務めであろう……それにもかかわらず、<style=\"highlight\">奴らは祭祀を偽り、儂の追放を目論んだ</style>！父のように、この大地を愛した、この儂を！","source_cn":"凡人本该献上虔诚的信仰，助我从堕落的痛苦中恢复……他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x127C7281906007CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant